# Project plans location

When creating or updating plans for this project:

- Put plan files in [`.cursor/plans/`](.cursor/plans/) (e.g. `.cursor/plans/feature-name.plan.md`).
- Do not write new plans to `~/.cursor/plans/` for this project.
- If a plan was created elsewhere, move it into `.cursor/plans/` and continue editing it there.
